    "text": "hoodline.com\nwebsite\nAnnapolis\nTwo Men Allegedly Kidnapped at Gunpoint in Annapolis, Suspects Arrested and Charged\nBy Ahmed Hassan,\n15 hours agoEarly yesterday, Annapolis was the scene of a disturbing crime when two men were allegedly kidnapped at gunpoint. According to Annapolis Police, officers were alerted to a possible incident involving gunshots at around 12:30 a.m., near Americana Drive and Norman Drive. During their investigation, they came across one of the victims on the 1000 block of Bay Ridge Avenue. This individual recounted to the officers how he, along with another person, was accosted and subsequently assaulted by three armed suspects who forced them into a black sedan. WMAR2 News reported this information.",
